{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o169","title":"鱼豢常从隗禧问《左氏传》，禧答欲知幽微莫若《易》、人伦之纪莫若《礼》、多识山川草木之名莫若《诗》，《左氏》直相斫书耳；豢因从问《诗》，禧说齐、韩、鲁、毛四家义","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-f6fdc9c14877012b0a8c","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"鱼豢常从隗禧问《左氏传》，禧答欲知幽微莫若《易》、人伦之纪莫若《礼》、多识山川草木之名莫若《诗》，《左氏》直相斫书耳；豢因从问《诗》，禧说齐、韩、鲁、毛四家义","evidence":["zhonghua-q-183f14aa3e74606a818a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhonghua-p0088","role":"答问授学者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-183f14aa3e74606a818a"]},{"person":"zhonghua-p0092","role":"从问者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-183f14aa3e74606a818a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-183f14aa3e74606a818a"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-183f14aa3e74606a818a","source_order":[13,519,171],"order":2944}],"persons":[{"id":"zhonghua-p0092","name":"鱼豢","evidence":["zhonghua-q-183f14aa3e74606a818a"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-183f14aa3e74606a818a","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-5281c70c1f9dd164041f","layer":"pei","quote":"豢又常从问《左氏传》，禧答曰：‘欲知幽微，莫若《易》；人伦之纪，莫若《礼》；多识山川草木之名，莫若《诗》。《左氏》，直相斫书耳，不足精意也。’豢因从问《诗》，禧说齐、韩、鲁、毛四家义；不复执文，有如讽诵。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":518,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-29aaab3281d7871e6af5","start":171,"end":273,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
